Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `reflect.of` can't capture `Ticket`
  --> tests/ui/reflect_of_refuse_single_use.jet:18:19
    |
 18 |     _: reflect.of(ticket)
    |                   ^^^^^^
 Why: A capture keeps its own copy of the whole value, and `Ticket` holds a `#SingleUse` value, whose one duty a copy would double
 Fix: Reflect the parts of the value that hold plain data instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
